&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1105&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e26b9645-39f8-44b6-8a4b-330f99e2a66b&quot;&gt;Diagnose and resolve issues related to server and network hardware within the data center.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1199&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ec9a18e1-7069-4a23-a0e2-55d536b70931&quot;&gt;Perform installation, upgrades, and decommissioning of IT hardware in accordance with operational requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
