&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of a programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in working with LLMs and developing skills and/or agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appreciation for software quality best practices: testing, clean code, design patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player with a genuine enthusiasm for knowledge sharing and problem-solving&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
