&lt;p&gt;The Delivery team has the following performance indicators:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/infrastructure/performance-indicators/#mean-time-to-production-mttp&quot;&gt;Mean Time to Production&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
