&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you&#39;ll be the technical anchor for GitLab&#39;s Nonlinear Productivity team in the US: the person who decides what &quot;proven&quot; means before something ships, and who helps shape what the team builds next, not just how to build it. It&#39;s a from-scratch, generalist team with no dedicated product manager — that ownership starts on day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some examples of the problems this team takes on:&lt;/p&gt;
